================================================================================
IMPLEMENTATION CHANGES
================================================================================

Crate: siss-otel-tracer
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

FIX: First-Deny-Wins Semantics
  Location: MandateDecision::add_phase_outcome()
  Change: Only capture deny_phase and deny_reason on FIRST deny
  
  Before:
    if outcome.result == Decision::Deny {
        self.decision = Decision::Deny;
        self.deny_phase = Some(outcome.phase);        ❌ Overwrites every time
        self.deny_reason = outcome.deny_reason.clone();
    }
  
  After:
    if outcome.result == Decision::Deny {
        self.decision = Decision::Deny;
        if self.deny_phase.is_none() {                ✅ Only on first deny
            self.deny_phase = Some(outcome.phase);
            self.deny_reason = outcome.deny_reason.clone();
        }
    }
  
  Impact: Cockpit now correctly shows root cause (first failing phase)
          even if subsequent phases also deny

All Other Crates: No changes required
  - siss-telemetry-router: Implementation already correct
  - siss-audit-archiver: Implementation already correct
  - siss-bandwidth-monitor: Implementation already correct

