ARCHITECTURE VALIDATION
================================================================================

✅ Trace Propagation (Wave 3 → behavioral firewall integration point)
   - trace_id unique per task, propagates through 3 evaluation phases
   - root_span_id identifies orchestrator entry point
   - agent_id & task_id linked for cockpit filtering

✅ Phase Outcome Recording (Latency visibility for Wave 4 scaling)
   - ReBAC: latency + PostgreSQL query count (for graph performance tuning)
   - AP2: latency + denied rule name + predicate failure reason
   - Temporal: latency + rate-limit context (window, requests, limit)

✅ SSE Routing to Cockpit (Phase 32 integration)
   - 100ms latency budget enforced end-to-end
   - Deny events route immediately (mandate_denial)
   - Slow allows flagged for orchestrator warning (mandate_allow_slow)
   - Phase breakdown preserves evaluation order for root-cause analysis

✅ Audit Archive Lifecycle (Compliance & forensics)
   - Hot storage (PostgreSQL): 90 days, indexed, queryable from cockpit
   - Cold storage (S3): Indefinite, partitioned by year/month, immutable
   - Cryptographic hash verification prevents tampering

✅ Bandwidth Monitoring (Security & isolation)
   - Per-agent network I/O tracked (bytes_sent, bytes_received)
   - Unexpected egress triggers CRITICAL alert (sandbox breach detection)
   - Blocked connection attempts counted (probing detection)
   - Anomaly score cumulative across multiple violation types


